<title>USA: Iraq gets US wheat tender offers for reply Monday.</title>
<headline>Iraq gets US wheat tender offers for reply Monday.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraq has received offers in its tender for 50,000 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat and a reply is expected early next week, several U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>&quot;The offers are today and a reply will be on Monday,&quot; one exporter said.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for May 15-June 15.</p>
<p>The wheat would be purchased under a United Nations-monitored oil-for-food deal.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
